  "dataNotes": "Everything comes from the official Chambers Bay scorecard PDF (Golf ScoreCards Inc., 10/2025) on chambersbaygolf.com: hole pars, Black yards, men's stroke indexes, and men's ratings/slopes. Black/Blue (6,961, 73.4/136) and Blue/Sand (6,542, 71.5/132) combo tees are also on the card but are not listed here. On this card hole 1 is a par 4 and hole 18 a par 5. The 2015 U.S. Open alternated those two holes between par 4 and par 5. The fescue greens were converted to poa annua in 2017–19. Photos are from 2014–15, before that conversion. Hole names come from Cascade Golfer's hole-by-hole guide. Golf Monthly and Kingdom Magazine independently confirm holes 1, 4, 9, 15, and 18.",
